        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Loop row: draw up a loop from every stitch onto the dowel (45 loops). Cluster row: slide 5 loops off, ch 1, work 5 dc through the centre; repeat (9 clusters). Repeat loop and cluster rows until the runner is 120 cm long." }]
